{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、真夏にネックレスを直してもらったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆー謎の情報"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、\n今日は\nお茶会とサイン会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶会では\n神経衰弱やったよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数万円のティーカップに\nダージリンのいい香りのする\nお紅茶を注いで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いや、嘘。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紙パックのお茶だった(゜ロ゜)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶会とかどーなるんだろ〜\nって思ってたけど\n普通に楽しくてびっくり＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次にサイン会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田レーンは乃木坂グッズ率高し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン会とか\nアイドルしてる気分でした＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい話せた〜(*°-°*)\nでも話ながら書くのはちょっと難しい(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のサインとか価値ないかもだけど\n大事にしてくださると光栄です＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ、ろってぃー、れいか、まいやん、かずみん\nのユニット曲\n『私のために　誰かのために』が\n今日の会場で初公開でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうひとつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっきーなとせっちゃんは\n乃木坂として活動するのが\n今日で最後でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/11/17/8553931/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてる事とか言う事とか面白